app/run/langs/teavm.ts is a port of TeaVM's WebAssembly runtime JavaScript
(*.wasm-runtime.js), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(licenses/Apache-2.0.txt). It was changed to run without eval: the interop
helpers TeaVM builds with `new Function` are plain closures, and @JSBody
snippets are resolved from a fixed table (app/run/langs/teavm-jsbody.ts).
